id: operation.tool_routing
category: operation
status: verified
date: 2026-08-24
content: Task routing should match complexity to capability — simple tasks to secondary
  LLM (CPU), complex tasks to primary LLM (GPU).
notes: 'Simple tasks: file reads, basic commands, searches → secondary LLM (Granite4.1-8B)

  Complex tasks: planning, refactoring, multi-file changes → primary LLM (Qwen3.6-35B)

  Ambiguous tasks default to primary LLM (safe choice)

  Keywords determine routing: check COMPLEX_TASK_KEYWORDS and SIMPLE_TASK_KEYWORDS

  This reduces primary model context pressure and improves response quality

  '
metadata: {}
prerequisites: []
blocking: []
tags:
- tool-routing
- llm-selection
- complexity
- cpu
- gpu
