id: operation.context_compression
category: operation
status: verified
date: ''
content: Tektos compresses knowledge into axioms that survive context compaction.
  Axioms are self-contained, verifiable, and machine-parseable.
notes: The axiom system (axioms.py) manages this. Each axiom has an ID, category,
  status, and metadata.
metadata: {}
